# 换行策略：仓库内统一存 LF，工作区按平台检出
# 默认：文本文件 LF 检出、LF 提交（不随平台变化）
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须是 CRLF，否则 cmd.exe 解析异常
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制资产，明确禁止行尾转换
*.onnx binary
*.wasm binary
*.sog binary
*.ply binary
*.btree binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.glb binary
*.jpg binary
*.png binary
*.zip binary

# 差异工具友好：把 .mjs/.js 标为 JS，.md 标为 Markdown
*.mjs diff=javascript
*.js diff=javascript
*.md diff=markdown
*.json diff=json
